            "sid": "HOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ngeeĩvanĩsya kwake mĩthenya ya Mbaalimu, ila watoeesye ũvani, yĩla weseũvĩsye mwene na ngome sya matũ, na mĩio yake ya wanake, na kũatĩĩa endwa make, na oolwa ninyie, easya ũu Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
